AB  - In response to the industry pain points of low content supply efficiency, rigid forms, and insufficient personalized adaptability in current cybersecurity education, as well as the research gap in the integrated generation and recommendation solutions of AIGC technology in the vertical education field, this paper designs and implements an AIGC animation generation and personalized recommendation system for cybersecurity education. The system first builds a vertical domain knowledge base covering the core knowledge points of cybersecurity and a content compliance normative system. It uses a large language model fine-tuned based on domain instructions to automatically generate educational animation storyboards, and employs a LoRA fine-tuned AnimateDiff diffusion model to complete the standardized rendering of coherent animation visual content. It integrates voice synthesis and subtitle generation modules to output complete animation works. At the same time, it adopts a Wide&Deep deep recommendation model to build a personalized recommendation module that integrates multidimensional user portraits and the progressive logic of knowledge points, and is equipped with a full-chain multi-modal content security review mechanism. To verify the effectiveness and performance of the system, this paper sets up a dedicated experimental environment to complete multi-dimensional comparative tests. The results show that the ROUGE-L value of the fine-tuned script generation model reaches 87.2%, an increase of 19.5 percentage points compared to the baseline of the general large language model. The FID value of the animation visual generation module drops to 12.38, and the subjective MOS score for content educational adaptability reaches 4.62/5.00. The recommendation model adopted in this paper improves the Top10 NDCG value by 22.7% compared to the traditional collaborative filtering model. In the online A/B test, the user content completion rate increases by 31.4%. All functions and performance indicators of the system meet the requirements for large-scale application. This research realizes the low-cost large-scale generation and precise personalized distribution of cybersecurity education animation content, providing a reusable technical solution and practical reference for the digital and intelligent transformation of cybersecurity education.
ER  - 

